    "title": "Inspector finds several violations at popular cigar and wine bar in The Villages - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Staff Report ,\n5 hours ago An inspector found several violations at a popular cigar and wine bar in The Villages. The inspector paid a visit to Holy Sh’mokes at 1521 Buenos Aires Blvd. in The Villages on April 9 and found that its operating license with the Florida Division of Hotels and Restaurants had expired on April 1, according to a report on file with the Florida Department of Business and Professional Regulation. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
